        "id": 5230
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-01T16:10:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would argue that, to preserve sanity, from GrDrawingManager::flush on up, the call stack should return a different pair of { bool success, GrSemaphoresSubmitted }.\nThe semaphore status would then be directly returned from GrGpu::executeFlushInfo and we could avoid all the crazy logic.\nUltimately, I guess, we would surface this in the public API?",
      "parentUuid": "48ff72d8_e3155fea",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 179,
        "startChar": 50,
        "endLine": 179,
        "endChar": 55
      },
      "revId": "eded207465d6fb93abe6400d4a898d06514b5988",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
